Follow `docs/for-agents/HARD-RULES.md`, `AGENTS.md` (pickup contract, lanes, Agent packet) and `AGENTS-MCS.md`. In short: pulled data never goes in git (local `local-data/` only); owner fields are names only, never values (D-13); nothing is surfaced or published before G6; MPAC- and NPCA-derived data may be pulled and used, all fields pulled and identifying information screened at publish (HARD-RULES 2, 4, 5); no workaround for gated sources; agents never merge. Open questions are in `heavymap-planning/OPEN-DECISIONS.md`: don't decide them.

Process insights (standing rule): before finishing any session or PR, append your process insights (sources found, dead ends, data quirks, method findings, effort estimates, gaps) as rows in `Spreadsheets/19-process-insights.csv` with live-verified evidence. See `heavymap-planning/PROCESS-INSIGHTS.md`. If you cannot write to the repo, list them in your final message under the heading `Process insights`.
